<title>USA: Market Facts sets div, to omit future divs.</title>
<headline>Market Facts sets div, to omit future divs.</headline>
<dateline>ARLINGTON, Ill. 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Market Facts Inc said on Monday that it has set a $0.10 a share quarterly dividend to be paid November 20, 1996, but the company's board set a policy to omit future dividends.</p>
<p>The company said that it believes that its funds would be better used for corporate growth.</p>
<p>The November dividend will be paid to shareholders of record on November 13, 1996, the company said.</p>
